{"seq":3,"slug":"persistence-database","title":"持久化与数据库选型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-server-architecture/infrastructure/persistence-database","wordCount":1619,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"持久化与数据库选型\">持久化与数据库选型</h1><p>游戏服务器处理的数据分为两类：热数据（当前匹配状态，生命周期 = 一局比赛）和冷数据（玩家档案、物品、排行榜，生命周期 = 永久）。热数据存在内存中随 Tick 循环更新；冷数据需要持久化到数据库，并在玩家上线时快速加载、下线时可靠存储。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>游戏持久化架构围绕<strong>分层存储</strong>展开：热层（进程内存/Redis）服务实时读写、温层（DynamoDB/PostgreSQL）承载全量玩家数据、冷层（S3）归档历史记录。关键设计抉择包括：一致性模型选择（货币/物品必须强一致，社交/统计可最终一致）、缓存策略（Write-Back 提速 vs Write-Through 安全）、分片键选择（Player ID 分片最常见）、以及防回档攻击（WAL + 同步持久化关键事件）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"游戏数据的分类与存储需求\">游戏数据的分类与存储需求</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>数据类型</th>\n<th>一致性要求</th>\n<th>延迟要求</th>\n<th>访问模式</th>\n<th>典型技术选择</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>实时战斗状态</td>\n<td>强一致（单服务器内存）</td>\n<td>&lt;1ms</td>\n<td>纯内存读写</td>\n<td>进程内数据结构</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>玩家档案</td>\n<td>最终一致/强一致</td>\n<td>&lt;10ms</td>\n<td>点查为主</td>\n<td>Redis + DynamoDB/MongoDB</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>物品/背包</td>\n<td>强一致（事务性）</td>\n<td>&lt;50ms</td>\n<td>点查 + 批量更新</td>\n<td>PostgreSQL / DynamoDB</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>社交关系</td>\n<td>最终一致</td>\n<td>&lt;100ms</td>\n<td>图遍历</td>\n<td>Redis / 图数据库</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>排行榜</td>\n<td>最终一致</td>\n<td>&lt;50ms 读/&lt;200ms 写</td>\n<td>Top-K + 排名查询</td>\n<td>Redis Sorted Set</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>比赛记录</td>\n<td>追加写入，不可变</td>\n<td>无实时要求</td>\n<td>时序写入 + 范围扫描</td>\n<td>ClickHouse / DynamoDB</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>聊天/邮件</td>\n<td>最终一致</td>\n<td>&lt;200ms</td>\n<td>追加 + 分页读取</td>\n<td>MongoDB / Cassandra</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"内存缓存层设计\">内存缓存层设计</h2><p>几乎所有高频访问的游戏数据都需要一层内存缓存。Redis 是游戏行业的事实标准。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    GS[游戏服务器] --&gt;|&quot;读玩家数据&quot;| Cache{Redis 缓存}&#10;    Cache --&gt;|&quot;命中&quot;| GS&#10;    Cache --&gt;|&quot;未命中&quot;| DB[(持久化数据库)]&#10;    DB --&gt;|&quot;回填缓存&quot;| Cache&#10;    GS --&gt;|&quot;写操作&quot;| WB[Write-Back 队列]&#10;    WB --&gt;|&quot;批量异步写入&quot;| DB&#10;    GS --&gt;|&quot;关键事务&quot;| DB\">flowchart TD\n    GS[游戏服务器] --&gt;|\"读玩家数据\"| Cache{Redis 缓存}\n    Cache --&gt;|\"命中\"| GS\n    Cache --&gt;|\"未命中\"| DB[(持久化数据库)]\n    DB --&gt;|\"回填缓存\"| Cache\n    GS --&gt;|\"写操作\"| WB[Write-Back 队列]\n    WB --&gt;|\"批量异步写入\"| DB\n    GS --&gt;|\"关键事务\"| DB</pre><p><strong>缓存策略选择</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>策略</th>\n<th>读延迟</th>\n<th>数据新鲜度</th>\n<th>数据安全</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Cache-Aside</td>\n<td>首次慢，后续快</td>\n<td>可能读到旧数据</td>\n<td>缓存失效不丢数据</td>\n<td>玩家档案、配置表</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Write-Through</td>\n<td>写时略慢</td>\n<td>强一致</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>货币余额、关键属性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Write-Back (Write-Behind)</td>\n<td>写极快</td>\n<td>最终一致</td>\n<td>有丢数据窗口</td>\n<td>经验值、统计计数</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>游戏场景的特殊需求——<strong>玩家上线预热</strong>：当匹配服务确认玩家即将加入某个服务器时，可以提前向该服务器推送（或让服务器预拉取）玩家数据到缓存，使得玩家连接时无需等待数据库查询。</p>\n<h2 id=\"关系型数据库-vs-nosql\">关系型数据库 vs NoSQL</h2><h3 id=\"postgresql-的优势场景\">PostgreSQL 的优势场景</h3><ul>\n<li><strong>事务性操作</strong>：物品交易需要&quot;扣除 A 的物品 + 增加 B 的物品&quot;原子完成</li>\n<li><strong>复杂查询</strong>：运营后台的 Ad-hoc 分析、跨表 JOIN</li>\n<li><strong>Schema 强约束</strong>：防止脏数据写入</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"dynamodb-mongodb-的优势场景\">DynamoDB/MongoDB 的优势场景</h3><ul>\n<li><strong>水平扩展</strong>：单表千万行无需分库分表</li>\n<li><strong>低延迟点查</strong>：按 Player ID 查询固定 &lt;10ms</li>\n<li><strong>Schema 灵活</strong>：不同游戏模式可以存储不同结构的数据</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"混合方案-推荐\">混合方案（推荐）</h3><p>大多数生产游戏使用混合存储：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>总存储成本</mtext><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>Redis</mtext></msub><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>M</mi><mtext>hot</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>DynamoDB</mtext></msub><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>M</mi><mtext>warm</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>S3</mtext></msub><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>M</mi><mtext>cold</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{总存储成本} = C_{\\text{Redis}} \\times M_{\\text{hot}} + C_{\\text{DynamoDB}} \\times M_{\\text{warm}} + C_{\\text{S3}} \\times M_{\\text{cold}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">总存储成本</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">Redis</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">hot</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">DynamoDB</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">warm</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">S3</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">cold</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><ul>\n<li><strong>热层（Redis）</strong>：当前在线玩家的全部数据，TTL = 玩家离线后 30 分钟</li>\n<li><strong>温层（DynamoDB/PostgreSQL）</strong>：所有注册玩家数据，按需加载</li>\n<li><strong>冷层（S3/对象存储）</strong>：历史比赛回放、审计日志、长期归档</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"数据一致性模型\">数据一致性模型</h2><p>游戏中不同数据对一致性的要求差异巨大：</p>\n<p><strong>强一致性必须的场景</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>货币扣减（防止复制/刷钱）</li>\n<li>物品交易（防止复制物品）</li>\n<li>排位分数更新（防止并发写入导致分数异常）</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>最终一致性可接受的场景</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>好友列表更新（延迟几秒可接受）</li>\n<li>成就解锁通知（最终正确即可）</li>\n<li>聊天消息（偶尔乱序可接受）</li>\n</ul>\n<p>对于强一致性场景，分布式环境下的实现方式：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方案</th>\n<th>机制</th>\n<th>延迟</th>\n<th>适用规模</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>单主写</td>\n<td>所有写入路由到单个 Leader</td>\n<td>低（同区域）</td>\n<td>中小规模</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分布式事务</td>\n<td>2PC / Saga</td>\n<td>高（跨节点协调）</td>\n<td>需要跨服事务</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CAS (Compare-And-Swap)</td>\n<td>乐观锁，冲突重试</td>\n<td>低（无冲突时）</td>\n<td>高并发单行更新</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>事件溯源</td>\n<td>追加不可变事件，投影状态</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>需要审计追溯</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"数据分片策略\">数据分片策略</h2><p>当单个数据库实例无法承载所有玩家数据时，需要分片。游戏数据的分片键选择：</p>\n<p><strong>按 Player ID 分片</strong>（最常见）：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>优势：单个玩家的所有数据在同一分片，操作天然局部化</li>\n<li>劣势：社交关系查询可能跨分片</li>\n<li>分片函数：<code>shard_id = hash(player_id) % N</code></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>按区服分片</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>优势：同一服务器/区组的玩家数据集中</li>\n<li>劣势：合服/转服需要数据迁移</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>按数据类型分片</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>优势：不同类型数据独立扩展</li>\n<li>劣势：跨类型事务需要分布式协调</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"数据安全与防回档\">数据安全与防回档</h2><p>游戏数据面临的独特威胁是<strong>回档攻击</strong>——利用服务器崩溃导致最近的数据更新丢失。玩家消耗资源后触发崩溃（或利用已知的崩溃 bug），数据回滚到消耗前的状态，实现资源复制。</p>\n<p>防御措施：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>Write-Ahead Log (WAL)</strong>：关键操作先写日志再执行，崩溃后从日志恢复</li>\n<li><strong>同步持久化关键事件</strong>：货币变动、物品交易实时写入数据库，不依赖异步队列</li>\n<li><strong>操作幂等性</strong>：每个操作携带唯一 ID，重放日志时去重</li>\n<li><strong>快照 + 增量</strong>：定期全量快照 + 两次快照间的增量日志，崩溃后精确恢复</li>\n</ol>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>最大数据丢失窗口</mtext><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>write_back_interval</mtext></msub><mo>×</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mtext>sync_write</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{最大数据丢失窗口} = T_{\\text{write\\_back\\_interval}} \\times (1 - P_{\\text{sync\\_write}})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">最大数据丢失窗口</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0503em;vertical-align:-0.367em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">write_back_interval</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.367em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.117em;vertical-align:-0.367em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">sync_write</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.367em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mtext>sync_write</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_{\\text{sync\\_write}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0503em;vertical-align:-0.367em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">sync_write</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.367em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是同步写入的操作占比。关键操作同步写入时，该公式中对应部分的丢失窗口为 0。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>游戏持久化的核心挑战是在延迟、一致性和数据安全之间取得平衡。混合存储（Redis 热层 + DynamoDB/PG 温层 + S3 冷层）是行业默认方案。关键操作必须同步写入以防回档攻击，非关键操作可异步批量写入以降低延迟。分片按 Player ID 是最自然的选择，但跨服务事务（如交易）仍需分布式协调。</p>\n<hr>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>相关文档</strong>：<a href=\"session-management\">会话管理</a>描述玩家数据的加载/卸载时机；<a href=\"server-scaling-patterns\">服务器扩缩容模式</a>解释分片如何与实例调度配合。</p>\n</blockquote>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"持久化与数据库选型","id":"持久化与数据库选型"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"游戏数据的分类与存储需求","id":"游戏数据的分类与存储需求"},{"level":2,"text":"内存缓存层设计","id":"内存缓存层设计"},{"level":2,"text":"关系型数据库 vs NoSQL","id":"关系型数据库-vs-nosql"},{"level":3,"text":"PostgreSQL 的优势场景","id":"postgresql-的优势场景"},{"level":3,"text":"DynamoDB/MongoDB 的优势场景","id":"dynamodb-mongodb-的优势场景"},{"level":3,"text":"混合方案（推荐）","id":"混合方案-推荐"},{"level":2,"text":"数据一致性模型","id":"数据一致性模型"},{"level":2,"text":"数据分片策略","id":"数据分片策略"},{"level":2,"text":"数据安全与防回档","id":"数据安全与防回档"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"会话管理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-server-architecture/infrastructure/session-management"},"next":{"title":"网络协议设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-server-architecture/networking/protocol-design"}}